{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_165_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，宋公使向戌來聘。二月，己亥，及向戌盟於劉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_165_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"二、劉夏逆王后於齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_165_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"過我，故志之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_165_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"三、夏，齊侯伐我北鄙，圍成。公救成，至遇。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_165_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"四、季孫宿、叔孫豹帥師城成郛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_165_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"五、秋，八月，丁巳，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_165_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"六、邾人伐我南鄙。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_165_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_165","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有一月癸亥，晉侯周卒。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}